msgid ""
"Dizaynni tanlang, ma'lumotlaringizni kiriting va tayyor taklifnomani shu "
"zahoti ko'ring — bor-yo'g'i 5 daqiqada, ro'yxatdan o'tmasdan. To'lov — faqat"
" yoqqanidan keyin."
msgstr ""
"Choose a design, enter your details and see your invitation instantly — in "
"just 5 minutes, no sign-up. Pay only if you love it."

msgid "Barcha dizaynlarni ko'rish"
msgstr "View all designs"

msgid "So'nggi taklifnomalar"
msgstr "Recent invitations"

msgid "Platformamizda faollashtirilgan taklifnomalardan namunalar"
msgstr "Examples of invitations activated on our platform"

msgid "Qanday ishlaydi?"
msgstr "How does it work?"

msgid "Uch oddiy qadam — va taklifnomangiz tayyor"
msgstr "Three simple steps — and your invitation is ready"

msgid "Dizayn tanlang"
msgstr "Choose a design"

msgid ""
"Bir nechta tayyor shablondan o'zingizga yoqqanini tanlang — har biri o'ziga "
"xos uslubda."
msgstr ""
"Pick your favorite from several ready-made templates — each with its own "
"style."

msgid "Ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring"
msgstr "Fill in the details"

msgid ""
"Marosim turi, ismlar, sana, manzil, rasmlar va musiqa — hammasini o'zingiz "
"kiritasiz."
msgstr ""
"Event type, names, date, address, photos and music — you enter everything "
"yourself."

msgid "Ulashing"
msgstr "Share it"

msgid ""
"Tayyor taklifnomani ko'rib chiqing, yoqsa faollashtiring va yaqinlaringizga "
"Telegram yoki Instagram orqali yuboring."
msgstr ""
"Preview your invitation, activate it if you like it, and send it to loved "
"ones via Telegram or Instagram."

msgid "Dizayn shablonlari"
msgstr "Design templates"

msgid "Tanlang va shu zahoti o'zingiznikini yaratib ko'ring"
msgstr "Pick one and create yours right away"

msgid "Barchasi"
msgstr "All"

msgid "so'm"
msgstr "UZS"

msgid "Savol-javob"
msgstr "FAQ"

msgid "Ko'p so'raladigan savollar"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"

msgid "To'lovni qanday amalga oshiraman?"
msgstr "How do I make the payment?"

msgid ""
"Avval taklifnomangizni bepul yaratib, uni to'liq ko'rib chiqasiz. Yoqsa, "
"taklifnoma sahifasidagi \"Yoqdi\" tugmasini bosing — shu orqali sizni "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri Telegram'dagi adminimiz bilan bog'laymiz va to'lov "
"tafsilotlarini o'sha yerda kelishasiz. To'lov tasdiqlangach, taklifnomangiz "
"faollashtiriladi."
msgstr ""
"First you create your invitation for free and review it in full. If you like"
" it, press the \"Like\" button on the invitation page — this connects you "
"directly with our admin on Telegram, where you'll agree on the payment "
"details. Once payment is confirmed, your invitation is activated."

msgid "Ro'yxatdan o'tishim yoki parol o'ylab topishim kerakmi?"
msgstr "Do I need to register or come up with a password?"

msgid ""
"Yo'q. Hech qanday ro'yxatdan o'tish, email yoki parol talab qilinmaydi — "
"dizaynni tanlab, ma'lumotlaringizni kiritasiz, xolos. \"Mening "
"taklifnomalarim\" bo'limi orqali shu brauzeringizda yaratgan barcha "
"taklifnomalaringizni istalgan vaqt qayta topishingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"No. No registration, email, or password is required — you just choose a "
"design and fill in your details. Through the \"My invitations\" section you "
"can find all the invitations you've created in this browser again at any "
"time."

msgid "Ma'lumotlarda xato qilib qo'ysam, tuzata olamanmi?"
msgstr "If I made a mistake in the details, can I fix it?"

msgid ""
"Ha. Xuddi shu ism bilan formani qayta to'ldirsangiz, tizim avvalgi "
"taklifnomangizni taniydi va uni yangilashni yoki alohida saqlashni so'raydi."
" Kattaroq o'zgarish yoki muammo bo'lsa, taklifnoma sahifasidagi \"Yoqdi\" "
"tugmasi orqali to'g'ridan-to'g'ri adminimizga yozishingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"Yes. If you fill out the form again with the same names, the system "
"recognizes your previous invitation and asks whether to update it or save it"
" as a separate one. For a bigger change or a problem, you can message our "
"admin directly through the \"Like\" button on the invitation page."

msgid "Taklifnoma linki qachon tugaydi?"
msgstr "Does the invitation link expire?"

msgid ""
"Avtomatik tugamaydi — to'y yoki marosim o'tib ketgandan keyin ham link "
"ishlab turadi. Uni faolsizlantirish kerak bo'lsa, faqat qo'lda (admin "
"panelidan) qilinadi."
msgstr ""
"It doesn't expire automatically — the link keeps working even after the "
"wedding or event is over. Deactivating it is only ever done manually, from "
"the admin panel."

msgid "Mehmonlarim javobini (kelaman/kelolmayman) kuzatib borsam bo'ladimi?"
msgstr "Can I track my guests' responses (attending / not attending)?"

msgid ""
"Ha. Har bir taklifnomaning faqat sizga ko'rinadigan maxfiy statistika "
"sahifasi bor — u yerda nechta kishi ko'rgani, kim \"kelaman\" yoki "
"\"kelolmayman\" deb javob bergani va mehmonlarga bergan shaxsiy "
"linklaringizni kim ko'rib-ko'rmaganini kuzatib borasiz. Havolasini "
"\"Taklifnomangiz tayyor!\" sahifasida topasiz."
msgstr ""
"Yes. Every invitation has a private statistics page visible only to you — "
"there you can track how many people have viewed it, who answered "
"\"attending\" or \"not attending,\" and who has or hasn't seen the personal "
"links you gave your guests. You'll find the link on the \"Your invitation is"
" ready!\" page."

msgid "Nechta rasm va qanday musiqa qo'sha olaman?"
msgstr "How many photos and what music can I add?"

msgid ""
"Taklifnomangizga eng ko'pi bilan 2 ta o'z rasmingizni (har biri 8 MB gacha) "
"yoki tayyor namunalardan tanlab qo'shishingiz mumkin. Musiqa uchun ham "
"o'zingiznikini yuklashingiz (15 MB gacha) yoki tayyor variantlardan birini "
"tanlashingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"You can add up to 2 of your own photos (up to 8 MB each) or choose from the "
"ready-made samples. For music, you can also upload your own (up to 15 MB) or"
" pick one of the ready-made options."

msgid "Qaysi tillarda ishlaydi?"
msgstr "What languages does it support?"

msgid ""
"Sayt 8 tilda ishlaydi: o'zbek, rus, ingliz, tojik, qozoq, qirg'iz, turkman "
"va qoraqalpoq. Til tanlash tugmasi har bir sahifaning yuqori qismida "
"joylashgan."
msgstr ""
"The site works in 8 languages: Uzbek, Russian, English, Tajik, Kazakh, "
"Kyrgyz, Turkmen, and Karakalpak. The language switcher is at the top of "
"every page."

msgid "Taklifnoma hali faollashtirilmagan"
msgstr "Invitation not yet activated"

msgid "Bu taklifnoma sahifasi hali tayyor emas"
msgstr "This invitation page isn't ready yet"

msgid ""
"Bu havola hozircha faollashtirilmagan. Iltimos, taklifnoma egasi bilan "
"bog'laning."
msgstr "This link is not yet activated. Please contact the invitation owner."

msgid "Bosh sahifa"
msgstr "Home"

msgid ""
"Bu ro'yxat sizning shu brauzerda yaratgan barcha taklifnomalaringizni "
"ko'rsatadi — ularni solishtirib, eng yoqqanini tanlashingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"This list shows all invitations you've created in this browser — compare "
"them and pick your favorite."

msgid "Yana bitta yaratish"
msgstr "Create another"

msgid "Faollashtirilgan"
msgstr "Activated"

msgid "To'lov kutilmoqda"
msgstr "Awaiting payment"

msgid "Ko'rish"
msgstr "View"

msgid "Statistika"
msgstr "Statistics"

msgid "Yoqdi"
msgstr "Like"

msgid ""
"DIQQAT: bu taklifnoma FAOLLASHTIRILGAN — mehmonlarga yuborilgan va RSVP "
"javoblari bo'lishi mumkin! O'chirilsa, darhol ko'rinmay qoladi (30 kun "
"ichida administratorga murojaat qilib tiklash mumkin). Rostdan ham davom "
"etasizmi?"
msgstr ""
"WARNING: this invitation is ACTIVATED — it may have been sent to guests and "
"have RSVP replies! If deleted, it will disappear immediately (you can "
"contact the administrator within 30 days to restore it). Are you sure you "
"want to continue?"

msgid ""
"Rostdan ham ushbu taklifnomani butunlay o'chirmoqchimisiz? Bu amalni ortga "
"qaytarib bo'lmaydi."
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you want to permanently delete this invitation? This action "
"cannot be undone."

msgid "O'chirish"
msgstr "Delete"

